  "chapter_note": "The chunk’s strength is a tightly attested lexical catalogue that recovers every departure from the King James by the letters themselves, the KJV’s own renderings elsewhere, and the elder Greek and Latin witnesses. Parallel structure in the opening rule sentence breaks on “neither does,” which cannot govern the affirmative “gets a vote.” One recovery sentence opens with And after a period. The closing “Weigh them all” is residual presenter staging. The rest of the list and the final assembly remain dense, law-positive, and free of register slips.",
